I have just started a document review space at Quick Topic to discuss
my "Linux on the Acer TravelMate 330T" paper. To participate in
the review, use your browser to go to:

http://www.quicktopic.com/14/D/FVwSWCRWj6Z.html

You don't have to register or sign in, and you can choose to receive
email for newly posted messages -- just click the Subscribe button
when you get there.

What's new here is the way the document is being reviewed; Quick Topic
is a free discussion space where you can start your own topic or
document review in about 20 seconds (http://www.quicktopic.com/) --
it's a service that has an interesting pedegree for those of you who
know who's who in the blogger world ;)

Anyway, if anyone wants to add any comments to this paper (even though
the Acer 330T is a two-year-old machine), please feel free, and if
all you take away from it is the method of document review, well that's
cool too.

